# ====
# GitHub / Copilot / Agentic AI
# ====
# Keep repository-level Copilot customizations versioned under .github/.
# - .github/copilot-instructions.md, instructions/, agents/, skills/, agentic-ai/, mcp/, plans/, audits/, research/, and reviews/ are tracked static sources.
# - .github/inboxes/ is local-only operational scratch and is intentionally ignored.
# - AGENTS.md at the repository root and nested AGENTS.md files (e.g. tutor-studio/AGENTS.md) are intentionally tracked for third-party coding agent compatibility (agents.md standard).
# Agent-private memory (/memories/, /memories/session/, /memories/repo/) lives in the user profile and is never inside this repo; no entry needed here.
# Agent scratch artifacts that must never be committed:
*.session.md
*.draft.md
*.transcript.md
.github/inboxes/*

# Developer-local documentation stacks; humans/developers populate these locally.
docs/dev/

jenkins-workspace/
